An app root with a real, page-less `app/` directory.

`installPageRoutes` scans `<appSrcRoot>/app` eagerly and throws ENOENT when it
is missing (web/src/server/install-page-routes.ts:201). web-connector.spec.ts
points its harness here so that a WebConnector whose `ssrLoadModule` call was
"simplified" into a plain `import()` fails the way it would in a real app —
silently, with an unconnected shared store — instead of crashing on a missing
directory and hiding the bug behind an ENOENT.
